roles.basic_qualifications:
Desired Candidate Profile
- Qualified Chartered Accountant with 1–2 years of post-qualification experience in financial reporting or audit or semi qualified chartered accountant with 5-6 years of experience.
- Sound knowledge of Ind AS and its practical application in financial statement preparation;
- Exposure to listed company compliance and processes is preferred;
- Experience in assisting with statutory / limited review audits and dealing with audit queries;
- Familiarity with consolidation accounting and related party reporting;
- Strong proficiency in Microsoft Excel including advanced formulas, pivot tables and data management;
- Good interpersonal and communication skills with the ability to coordinate across teams and functions;
- Ability to manage multiple deliverables and meet stringent deadlines;
- Knowledge of / exposure to ERP systems is an advantage;
- Detail-oriented, proactive and a strong team player.

(Header line: "Education Qualification: Qualified Chartered Accountant / Semi Qualified Chartered Accountant. Experience: 1–2 years post-qualification or semi qualified chartered accountant with 5-6 years of experience")
